guarantee: AC5: each newer state is emitted with its own seq
file: crates/voicen-core/src/overlay.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
            (WindowPhase::Live, Some((seq, false))) if newer => WindowAction::Emit(seq),
--- new
            (WindowPhase::Live, Some((seq, false))) if newer => WindowAction::Emit(seq.saturating_sub(1)),
--- end
